[statement]
A name some package carries does not wait as a name packages only provide
does (`a-name-no-candidate-apk-would-choose-answers-is-decided-last`):
`top` needs `x` and `B`; `B`'s one candidate, `b`, provides `x` at no
version and cannot stand beside `x` 1, which leaves `x` no candidate apk
would choose. apk refuses rather than let `B` answer `x`. Asked for `x`
and `B` together, apk installs `b` alone.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:x B

P:x
V:1

P:b
V:1
p:B=1 x

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| ERROR: unable to select packages:
|   x-1:
|     conflicts: b-1
|     satisfies: top-1[x]
|   b-1:
|     conflicts: x-1[x]
|     satisfies: top-1[x] top-1[B]
refused
